    <core-gate>
      BLOCKED on core E-20 (`DispositionRoutability` registry — admits `compose` at the dispatch admit-gate `SessionDispatchOrchestrator.cs:229`) AND E-40 (formal `tests/integration/seam/**` KEEP category + governance). The test CANNOT pass end-to-end until E-20 lands (compose disposition currently 422s at the admit-gate). Author + run only after E-20 is on master. Verify via `notes/HANDOFF-to-core-e20-timing-and-forkc-reping.md`.
    </core-gate>
